<h2>Ocelli 2.2.1</h2>
<p class="intro">Bring in recordings you made elsewhere, and let dictation send for you.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Import recordings. Drop an audio or video file on the library window, or choose one in Settings. It becomes a transcript and a note, just like a recorded meeting.</li>
  <li>Auto Send for dictation. Ocelli can press Return for you after pasting, per app.</li>
  <li>Dictation starts faster and no longer misroutes takes that contain pauses.</li>
  <li>Solo recordings are no longer split into two speakers.</li>
  <li>Summaries retry automatically when the AI service has a hiccup.</li>
  <li>Cleaner status rows in the sidebar.</li>
</ul>
